1
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:32,740
Madam , it 's good that we shifted into a new house .

2
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:34,660
Why ?

3
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:37,660
What made you develop a liking for this house within a night ?

4
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:40,820
That old house was so close to the airport , it was always noisy .

5
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,180
One couldn 't sleep peacefully even for a moment .

6
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:48,380
- Granny , I drank the milk . - Very good !

7
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:50,340
- Na ray an ! - Yes madam ?

8
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:52,100
- Drop Bunty to the bus stop . - Come , Bunty !

9
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:54,820
Tell the driver about our new house .

10
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:57,300
- He should pick Bunty from here next time . - Yes madam !

11
00:06:57,380 --> 00:06:58,900
- Bye granny ! - Bye Bunty !

12
00:07:02,500 --> 00:07:03,580
Keep it carefully .

13
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:07,700
Careful ! This way .

14
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:13,020
- Listen ! - Hmm .

15
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:16,300
The lorry hasn 't arrived yet with the rest of the stuff .

16
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:18,820
I 've just received a call . The lorry has left from there .

17
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,780
- Good morning ! - Good morning !

18
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:29,860
Good morning !

19
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:32,100
I 've asked you so many times ,

20
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:34,300
not to go to the college dressed like this .

21
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:37,580
What 's wrong with this dress ?

22
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,860
When I ask you to do something you tend to question me back .

23
00:07:42,660 --> 00:07:43,660
Dad !

24
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:46,180
Shalini , this is present day 's fashion .

25
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:48,220
Let her wear what she feels like .

26
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,820
You 'll always support her .

27
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:54,900
- Come Mini , breakfast is ready . - I don 't need breakfast .

28
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,820
- Why ? - I 've planned to eat in the canteen with my friends .

29
00:07:59,780 --> 00:08:01,060
You should 've informed me before .

30
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,740
I made cutlets because you like them .

31
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:07,860
I forgot mom . Please , this time .

32
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:10,500
Okay Shalini , let it be . It 's just a small issue .

33
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:13,820
- Okay go . As it is you never listen to me . - Hello aunty !

34
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:16,220
Hi !

35
00:08:16,340 --> 00:08:18,100
- Okay , mom ! Bye , dad ! - Bye Mini .

36
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:19,340
C 'mon , let 's go .

37
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:21,260
Rashmi 's house is nearby now .

38
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,220
She 'll not even remember her own house now .

39
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,340
She forgot her purse .

40
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:30,740
Mini , your purse . You 'd forgotten it .

41
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:34,700
Mom !

42
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:40,500
- If you wish , I 'll have the breakfast . - It 's okay .

43
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:42,580
- Bye ! - Bye !

44
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,380
Can 't you see ?

45
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:38,580
Slowly !

46
00:09:40,300 --> 00:09:41,780
Be careful , don 't bang the door frame .

47
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:45,860
Bring it here .

48
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,140
The bulb 's fused !

49
00:09:58,900 --> 00:09:59,900
Be careful !

50
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:03,300
Slowly !

51
00:10:03,660 --> 00:10:06,156
Na ray an , the remaining things from the truck should be put here .

52
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:07,180
Very well !

53
00:10:10,060 --> 00:10:11,060
Take it there .

54
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:14,300
- Hi ! - Hello !

55
00:11:18,140 --> 00:11:19,140
Yes . You know that 's why .

56
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,180
Just a minute .

57
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:21,236
May be she is not feeling well .

58
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,900
C 'mon ! Really ?

59
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,500
- Professor Saxena was looking funny that day . - Yeah .

60
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:29,900
- Bye , see you ! - Bye , see you .

61
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:33,180
Let 's go to the library , I 've to return the books .

62
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:35,740
We 'll wait for another 10 minutes .

63
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:38,980
- Wait ? Why ? - I mean we 'll go after 10 minutes .

64
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,780
Oh ! I 've understood .

65
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:43,300
What did you understand ?

66
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:44,900
Hi , Deepak !

67
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:46,620
Hey ! Got you !

68
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:49,180
- What got you ? - Why were you looking there ?

69
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:51,100
Just like that .

70
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:53,700
Don 't fool me . I know everything .

71
00:11:58,300 --> 00:11:59,900
