72
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:04,300
- He 's really here . - Let him come . Who cares ?

73
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:07,220
- Hi Deepak ! - Hi !

74
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,460
- Hi Mini ! - Hi .

75
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,620
- She was waiting for you . - Shut up !

76
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,100
