77
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:14,260
Stupid , it 's time for the movie .

78
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:17,100
There 's a new film at Sterling . Good comedy . Let 's go .

79
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:20,740
- What about the class ? - Forget the class . Let 's go !

80
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:21,980
Come !

81
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:27,780
You didn 't understood . No one 's a bigger idiot than you .

82
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,620
I knew that these two had decided on a movie .

83
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:32,300
- Isn 't it , Mini ? - Yes , who 'll rot in that fatso 's class ?

84
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,660
- Did you see how right my guess was ? - Yes . Okay .

85
00:12:35,140 --> 00:12:36,140
Shall we eat something ?

86
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:43,420
- You were waiting impatiently for him . - I 'll have popcorn .

87
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:47,476
- She wants something . - What will you have Mini ?

88
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,116
- Give me a cold drink . - Everything that 's available !

89
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,140
Thank you .

90
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:49,780
