91
00:16:58,100 --> 00:16:59,100
Oh god !

92
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:13,660
Listen , can I get bread from somewhere here ?

93
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:16,300
Yes , there 's a shop ahead . I too am going there .

94
00:17:17,780 --> 00:17:19,900
- We shifted to this house yesterday itself . - I know .

95
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:21,100
