96
00:17:21,260 --> 00:17:23,860
You were dropping your boss ' son to school .

97
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:27,620
- No . Bunty is his elder daughter 's son . - Ok .

98
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:30,900
His parents died in an accident .

99
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:34,820
- Ok , what 's your name ? - Shailu . I 'm working in Rashmi 's house .

100
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:41,980
- Granny , where 's my doll ? - In the cupboard .

101
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:44,820
