102
00:17:45,300 --> 00:17:46,300
Give it now .

103
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,260
Look son , the cupboard is in the storeroom .

104
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:50,260
There are many things scattered there .

105
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:54,300
- No , I want it now . - Don 't trouble me .

106
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:25,140
- What 's the fare ? - 10 Rupees .

107
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:28,220
I 'll pay .

108
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:29,780
Leave my hand .

109
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:31,100
- Mini , I 'll pay . - Rashmi !

110
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:33,300
Hey !

111
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,580
We 'll settle the account later , ok ?

112
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,180
- Bye ! See you . - Bye .

113
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:41,900
Listen Mini ? Let 's go home .

114
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:44,300
Dad has given me a CD player on my birthday .

115
00:18:44,780 --> 00:18:48,700
- I 'll play Michael Jackson 's ' BAD ' for you . - Bad ? ! It 's so good .

116
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:49,900
Come .

117
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:07,220
Grandmother ?

118
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:10,580
Grandmother , this is Mini . My classmate .

119
00:19:10,780 --> 00:19:12,740
They 've come to stay in the next bungalow .

120
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:20,860
Next bungalow ?

121
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,660
Come , Mini .

122
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,100
Enter the dragon !

123
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:51,900
- Rashmi . - Hmm .

124
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:54,476
Why did your grandmother react in such a way ,

125
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:55,836
when you mentioned the bungalow ?

126
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:58,860
