127
00:20:08,340 --> 00:20:09,340
Mini !

128
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,020
Have you returned from the college ?

129
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:21,300
You !

130
00:20:25,580 --> 00:20:26,580
Lets dance .

131
00:22:57,500 --> 00:23:00,580
- Hi , mom ! - Hi ! Why are you so late ?

132
00:23:00,740 --> 00:23:01,740
I was at Rashmi 's house .

133
00:23:02,860 --> 00:23:04,900
- Where 's Bunty ? - He must be playing somewhere .

134
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:07,500
Bunty !

135
00:23:20,340 --> 00:23:21,340
Bunty !

136
00:23:25,860 --> 00:23:26,860
Bunty !

137
00:23:28,980 --> 00:23:29,980
Where did he go ?

138
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:36,820
- Mom , Bunty 's not in his room . - Check in the storeroom ?

139
00:24:35,820 --> 00:24:36,820
Bunty ?

140
00:24:45,980 --> 00:24:46,980
Mini !

141
00:24:48,780 --> 00:24:49,820
What are you doing there ?

142
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:52,900
Granny , look what I found ?

143
00:24:54,100 --> 00:24:55,820
A cat ? Where did she come from ?

144
00:24:56,220 --> 00:24:57,580
What were you doing down there ?

145
00:24:57,700 --> 00:24:58,700
Come .

146
00:25:00,220 --> 00:25:02,300
It 'll scratch you . Hold it properly .

147
00:25:18,900 --> 00:25:22,060
Dad , you should 've seen the way Rashmi imitated her grandmother .

148
00:25:22,660 --> 00:25:26,180
Mini , when did you come from college ?

149
00:25:28,820 --> 00:25:32,180
I got so scared , dad ! She 's the limit !

150
00:25:32,260 --> 00:25:34,860
Enough Mini , we should not tease elders .

151
00:25:36,020 --> 00:25:37,740
Old age must be getting on to the poor lady .

152
00:25:38,300 --> 00:25:42,140
- Who else is in Rashmi 's family ? - Her parents .

153
00:25:42,900 --> 00:25:44,300
But both of them are working .

154
00:25:44,780 --> 00:25:46,820
They 're mostly out of the house .

155
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:49,220
I too , haven 't met them for many days .

156
00:25:49,660 --> 00:25:51,500
Bunty , what 're you doing ?

157
00:25:51,980 --> 00:25:53,900
I 'm feeding Meow .

158
00:25:55,820 --> 00:25:57,220
- Na ray an . - Yes madam ?

159
00:26:01,980 --> 00:26:03,900
- Take the cat out . - Ok .

160
00:26:04,580 --> 00:26:05,900
C 'mon Bunty , let 's go upstairs ?

161
00:26:08,780 --> 00:26:11,300
Granny can I take the cat upstairs ?

162
00:26:11,860 --> 00:26:14,100
No . Your dolly is there with you , isn 't it ?

163
00:26:14,180 --> 00:26:17,300
- Pass me the water . Please . - Then the cat and dolly will fight .

164
00:26:18,580 --> 00:26:21,460
You have to sleep early . There 's school tomorrow .

165
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:23,340
Yes dad , I forgot to tell you .

166
00:26:24,340 --> 00:26:25,820
Today morning in the college ,

167
00:26:25,900 --> 00:26:28,900
I don 't know what , but a very strange thing happened .

168
00:26:47,300 --> 00:26:49,900
Yes , like this .

169
00:26:55,300 --> 00:26:57,140
Tell me a story , granny .

170
00:26:57,340 --> 00:26:59,100
- Ok dear , goodnight . - Goodnight dad !

171
00:27:01,900 --> 00:27:02,900
Na ray an !

172
00:27:05,380 --> 00:27:06,380
Clear the table .

173
00:28:21,300 --> 00:28:22,300
- Mini ! - Yes ?

174
00:28:22,500 --> 00:28:24,340
Enough of T.V. C 'mon switch it off .

175
00:28:25,100 --> 00:28:26,300
Mom just a little while more .

176
00:28:26,860 --> 00:28:28,300
Don 't you have college tomorrow ?

177
00:28:28,900 --> 00:28:30,420
If you watch TV till late in the night ,

178
00:28:30,500 --> 00:28:33,060
