180
00:28:36,340 --> 00:28:37,660
Didn 't I ask you to switch it off ?

181
00:30:03,700 --> 00:30:05,380
I don 't know what 's happening to this girl ?

182
00:30:06,820 --> 00:30:08,540
She doesn 't listen to a single word of mine .

183
00:30:10,220 --> 00:30:12,300
It 's your love and pampering that has spoilt her .

184
00:30:13,780 --> 00:30:14,780
And you are ..

185
00:31:04,700 --> 00:31:05,900
- Hi mother ! Hi ! - Hi .

186
00:31:11,220 --> 00:31:12,220
C 'mon , have it .

187
00:31:12,900 --> 00:31:13,980
Sit and eat Mini .

188
00:31:14,100 --> 00:31:15,580
No mother , I 'm already late .

189
00:31:16,300 --> 00:31:17,300
See you ! Bye !

190
00:31:20,940 --> 00:31:21,940
Finish the bread .

191
00:31:42,500 --> 00:31:43,500
Bunty !

192
00:31:45,220 --> 00:31:46,620
Why did you keep the cat in the bag ?

193
00:31:47,500 --> 00:31:49,900
Granny , can I take the cat to school ?

194
00:31:50,580 --> 00:31:53,260
Look your teacher won 't allow the cat in school .

195
00:31:53,860 --> 00:31:55,900
You can play with him once you return , ok ?

196
00:31:56,340 --> 00:31:57,500
C 'mon , finish the bread .

197
00:32:03,140 --> 00:32:04,300
You won 't believe it .

198
00:32:04,900 --> 00:32:07,740
I can 't believe that it was a dream .

199
00:32:08,700 --> 00:32:11,100
Suddenly , two hands emerged through the wall and ..

200
00:32:11,700 --> 00:32:14,180
- My god ! It was terrifying . - Very strange !

201
00:32:15,620 --> 00:32:17,140
Even my grandmother says ,

202
00:32:17,700 --> 00:32:19,860
that hands emerge through the walls of your house .

203
00:32:21,900 --> 00:32:24,060
- What do you mean ? - Nothing , forget it .

204
00:32:24,260 --> 00:32:26,260
It must be a coincidence . Come !

205
00:32:29,700 --> 00:32:33,500
- Hi ! Where are you going ? - Home , where else ?

206
00:32:34,020 --> 00:32:36,340
- What 's your plan ? - We can go for an ice cream .

207
00:32:36,380 --> 00:32:38,740
- Sure ! Come along . - No , you go .

208
00:32:38,900 --> 00:32:39,820
You two go ahead .

209
00:32:39,900 --> 00:32:41,860
- Moreover , I have some work at home . - Thank you !

210
00:32:42,340 --> 00:32:43,900
- Have a nice time ! - Bye !

211
00:32:46,100 --> 00:32:47,300
- Bye ! - Bye !

212
00:33:06,980 --> 00:33:09,580
Mini , what 's the date tomorrow ?

213
00:33:11,820 --> 00:33:12,820
17th .

214
00:33:13,220 --> 00:33:14,220
So what ?

215
00:33:14,660 --> 00:33:17,500
Nothing , I just wanted to tell you , that tomorrow is the 17th .

216
00:33:18,820 --> 00:33:23,140
- 17th , tomorrow is your birthday isn 't it ? - Yes .

217
00:33:24,020 --> 00:33:26,100
Deepak , sometimes my memory ..

218
00:33:27,140 --> 00:33:28,700
Why do you take everything so seriously ?

219
00:33:29,100 --> 00:33:32,060
- Tell me , what do you want as gift ? - Nothing .

220
00:33:32,820 --> 00:33:34,820
There 's a picnic spot , 50 kilometers from here .

221
00:33:35,300 --> 00:33:37,900
We 'll both go there . Just the two of us .

222
00:33:40,700 --> 00:33:43,660
- We 'll return by evening . - Okay !

223
00:34:05,500 --> 00:34:08,100
Na ray an , clean this road too .

224
00:34:25,300 --> 00:34:26,300
Sir !

225
00:34:44,900 --> 00:34:46,820
The cat came under the car by mistake .

226
00:34:47,900 --> 00:34:49,580
Don 't tell Bunty . He 'll be very upset .

227
00:34:50,980 --> 00:34:52,740
Na ray an , bury it somewhere in the backyard .

228
00:35:02,900 --> 00:35:06,220
Yes ! Stop here .

229
00:35:08,140 --> 00:35:11,020
If mom notices that a guy has come to drop me here ,

230
00:35:11,620 --> 00:35:12,980
