231
00:35:13,660 --> 00:35:16,620
- That 's our new house . - Which one , right ?

232
00:35:16,860 --> 00:35:18,460
No . The white one next to it .

233
00:35:19,900 --> 00:35:21,620
Oh no , dad ?

234
00:35:33,020 --> 00:35:36,180
Deepak , what do you think ? Has dad seen us ?

235
00:35:36,340 --> 00:35:40,100
- Will there be a problem ? - No , there 'll be no problem .

236
00:35:40,820 --> 00:35:42,300
Just like that ! Anyway !

237
00:35:49,580 --> 00:35:52,100
- Hi ! Bunty ! - Mini aunty !

238
00:35:53,140 --> 00:35:54,580
- Bye Mini ! - Bye !

239
00:35:56,860 --> 00:35:57,860
See you tomorrow !

240
00:35:59,900 --> 00:36:02,340
So tell me , what did you learn in school today ?

241
00:36:02,380 --> 00:36:05,980
Jack and Jill , went up the hill , to fetch a pail of water !

242
00:36:06,060 --> 00:36:08,420
- Very good ! - Jack fell down ..

243
00:36:28,780 --> 00:36:31,820
Madam , I know that you don 't believe in all this ,

244
00:36:32,580 --> 00:36:35,820
but a cat 's death in the house is considered a bad omen .

245
00:36:40,260 --> 00:36:41,260
Granny !

246
00:36:42,020 --> 00:36:44,260
Fast ! Bunty has come . He shouldn 't know .

247
00:36:48,500 --> 00:36:50,140
