250
00:36:58,020 --> 00:37:00,700
The plant will grow . We 've just planted the seed .

251
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:02,740
But why are we planting it here , mother ?

252
00:37:04,900 --> 00:37:06,700
Go , change your clothes .

253
00:37:10,500 --> 00:37:12,380
