254
00:37:12,780 --> 00:37:13,780
It 'll be somewhere .

255
00:37:15,100 --> 00:37:17,700
Cat !

256
00:37:20,300 --> 00:37:21,300
The cat is dead .

257
00:38:13,580 --> 00:38:16,460
What 's happening here ?

258
00:38:17,180 --> 00:38:18,260
Wow !

259
00:38:21,180 --> 00:38:24,020
